Rate":"1","currencyPrice":0.0082,"currencySymbol":"$","isForeignDiscount":null,"ladderLevel":null}],"productImages":["https://assets.lcsc.com/images/lcsc/900x900/20221227_Samsung-Electro-Mechanics-CL10A475KP8NNNC_C1705_front.jpg","https://assets.lcsc.com/images/lcsc/900x900/20221227_Samsung-Electro-Mechanics-CL10A475KP8NNNC_C1705_back.jpg","https://assets.lcsc.com/images/lcsc/900x900/20221227_Samsung-Electro-Mechanics-CL10A475KP8NNNC_C1705_blank.jpg"],"edaSvgInfo":{"schSvg":"//image.easyeda.com/component_svgs/prod/e592817b387babbcc557afdb1c2313b9.svg?t=1701239902","pcbSvg":"//image.easyeda.com/component_svgs/prod/f8151fdc728a41ebbc304e11d39e5437.svg?t=1701239902"},"faqs":[{"question":"What are the key electrical specifications of the Samsung Electro-Mechanics CL10A475KP8NNNC MLCC?","answer":"The Samsung Electro-Mechanics CL10A475KP8NNNC is a multilayer ceramic chip capacitor (MLCC) with a nominal capacitance of 4.7µF. It has a ±10% (K) capacitance tolerance and a 10V DC rated working voltage. The capacitor features an X5R Class II dielectric and uses nickel (Ni) inner electrodes with Ni barrier and matte tin (Sn) plated terminations for solderability."},{"question":"What are the package size and physical dimensions of the CL10A475KP8NNNC?","answer":"The CL10A475KP8NNNC is supplied in a 0603 (1608 metric) package. Its nominal dimensions are 1.60 ± 0.10 mm in length, 0.80 ± 0.10 mm in width, and 0.80 ± 0.10 mm in height, in accordance with Samsung's standard 0603 MLCC package specification."},{"question":"What are the dielectric characteristics and operating temperature range of this capacitor?","answer":"The CL10A475KP8NNNC uses an X5R Class II dielectric. It provides a capacitance change within ±15% over an operating temperature range of −55°C to +85°C. For capacitors rated at 10V and below, the maximum dissipation factor (DF) is 5% under the specified test conditions. The insulation resistance meets Samsung's specified requirements as defined in the Reliability Test Condition section of the catalog."},{"question":"What applications is the CL10A475KP8NNNC suitable for?","answer":"This capacitor is suitable for general-purpose electronic applications such as power supply decoupling, bypassing, filtering, and coupling circuits. Samsung also lists applications including desktop PCs, notebook PCs, DC-DC converters, TVs, memory modules, handheld devices, digital still cameras, digital video cameras, LCD products, and game machines."},{"question":"What packaging and compliance information is available for the CL10A475KP8NNNC?","answer":"The \"C\" packaging code indicates cardboard tape supplied on a 7-inch reel. The capacitor is RoHS and REACH compliant and is manufactured using lead-free terminations with a Ni barrier and matte tin (Sn) plating."}],"pdfUrl":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/datasheet/pdf/02336ea48ea44ca18c72517dd3cb7b47.pdf?productCode=C1705","authenticationList":["ROHS3 认证"],"isRohsCert":true,"rohsCertType":"ROHS3","rohsCertList":[{"fileCode":"wj1864931","fileName":" 贴片电容(MLCC)_ROHS认证_SAMSUNG(三星).zip","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/fe72c154ab3703f908ae5b1ac157c1ec.zip"},{"fileCode":"wj1624669","fileName":"ROHS认证_贴片电容原材料_SAMSUNG(三星).zip","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/329ecc8904689d9af5b272ec0ed8e00a.zip"},{"fileCode":"wj1750838","fileName":"全量通用_ROHS认证_SAMSUNG(三星半导体).pdf","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/fe7ad62d96832adf9770d718059cff38.pdf"},{"fileCode":"wj1478399","fileName":"MLCCCL系列_ROHS认证(英文版)_SAMSUNG(三星).pdf","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/5b97a5d84519001adb216d4c9e6919ce.pdf"}],"productDescEn":"4.7uF ±10% 10V Ceramic Capacitor X5R 0603","productIntroEn":"4.7uF ±10% 10V Ceramic Capacitor X5R 0603","paramVOList":[{"paramCode":"param_10951_n","paramName":"容值","paramNameEn":"Capacitance","paramValue":"4.7uF","paramValueEn":"4.7uF","paramValueEnForSearch":4700000.0,"isMain":true,"sortNumber":1,"sort":1},{"paramCode":"param_10927","pa